---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Terminal Overview">
  <h1>Terminal</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Writr includes an embedded terminal tab powered by <code>xterm.js</code>, connected to a backend PTY session.
  </p>

  <h2>Safety notes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>It runs your system shell locally.</li>
    <li>Commands have the same effect as running them in your terminal.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Look & feel</h2>
  <p class="muted">Terminal theming and font settings follow your editor settings.</p>
</DocsLayout>

